WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,720
What happened to us when we rescued you?

2
00:00:01,720 --> 00:00:03,720
I owe you all for your attitude, Xiaoke.

3
00:00:03,720 --> 00:00:05,200
Why are you interrupting when adults are talking?

4
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:06,880
Do you understand that we are helpful?

5
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:08,720
Helping each other thousands of miles away

6
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:11,560
Did Captain Rong say no compensation? Is that what you said?

7
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:13,280
It seems like Captain Rong wants to take advantage of us.

8
00:00:13,280 --> 00:00:15,080
Captain Rong, how will he behave in front of others in the future?

9
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:17,440
I was wrong, Captain Han

10
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:18,840
Your men are right

11
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:20,040
It's because my subordinates are ignorant

12
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:27,310
Do you have the right to interrupt and receive the punishment?

13
00:00:27,310 --> 00:00:28,310
Go back and wrap it up

14
00:00:28,310 --> 00:00:36,350
There will be a heavy penalty next time

15
00:00:36,350 --> 00:00:37,430
Without further ado

16
00:00:37,430 --> 00:00:38,590
I'll take a batch with me first

17
00:00:38,590 --> 00:00:39,790
Let the women and children go first

18
00:00:39,790 --> 00:00:42,190
Just as Captain Han said

19
00:00:42,190 --> 00:00:43,710
You can only take two on this plane at a time, right?

20
00:00:43,710 --> 00:00:45,430
It is also my mission to fly more flights

21
00:00:45,430 --> 00:00:46,910
I will definitely rescue you all.
